  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rab 405.01 Procedure for Surrendering a License. Any person holding a license may voluntarily surrender that license by returning it to the board accompanied by a signed letter stating that they intend to surrender their license.\n\nSource. #10270, eff 2-2-13; EXPIRED: 2-2-23\n\nNew. #13968, eff 5-18-24",
